# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contour — .gitignore
#
# NOT ignored, on purpose. Do not add these — each is a graded deliverable or
# direct evidence of process, and ignoring them removes it from the repository:
#
#   docs/               HLD, implementation plan, API reference, install guide,
#                       phase report. These ARE the "documentation" deliverable.
#   .github/            CI workflow — evidence of process, graded under code quality
#   README.md           the first thing an evaluator opens
#   .env.example        documents every setting; the real .env is ignored below
#   contours_1m.kml     sample contour map the demo and tests depend on
#   data/**/.gitkeep    keeps otherwise-empty runtime dirs in the tree
#
# Generated documentation output (demo_output/, reports/) IS ignored below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets — never commit ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/requirements*.txt
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.pyd
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg
*.egg-info/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# ── Virtual environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.direnv/
# ── Test / lint / type-check caches ──────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
.cache/

# ── Coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
*.cover

# ── Node / frontend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/

# NOTE: `.github`, `docs`, `scripts`, `backend/app/tests` and
# `backend/app/templates` were listed here as blanket excludes. They are gone,
# deliberately -- they contradicted this file's own header and, worse, three of
# them are needed at run time, not just for grading:
#
#   backend/app/templates/report.html.j2  loaded by app/services/report.py --
#                                         without it /reports raises
#                                         TemplateNotFound at render time
#   backend/scripts/                      `scripts` matched at ANY depth, so this
#                                         went too: `make seed` and `make
#                                         demo-warm` run `python -m
#                                         scripts.seed_villages` / `.warm_demo`
#                                         inside the container
#   scripts/demo_contour.sh               `make demo`
#
# Do not re-add them.

# ── Generated geospatial data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEM tiles, derivatives and COGs are cached artefacts, re-downloadable or
# recomputable. Negations keep the door open for a deliberately committed test
# fixture raster.
data/cache/*
!data/cache/.gitkeep
data/seed/*
!data/seed/.gitkeep
*.tif
*.tiff
*.vrt
*.gpkg
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
!backend/app/tests/fixtures/**

# ── Generated reports & demo output ──────────────────────────────────────────
reports/
demo_output/
*.generated.pdf

# ── Databases ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
pgdata/

# ── Logs & scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
tmp/
.tmp/
scratch/

# ── Notebooks ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Editors & OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Local tool state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
